</style><div class="slide" style="top:0; left:0;"><div class="s0"></div><div style="position:absolute; top:65; left:0; width:720; height:389;"><div class="s2"><div class="s1"><p class="s3"><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s5">Кафедра патологической анатомии </span><span class="s6"><br></span><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s7">Кровотечения. Стаз. Тромбоз. </span><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s7">Шок. ДВС-синдром. Эмболия. </span><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s7">Ишемия. Инфаркт. Отеки</span><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s8"><br></span><span class="s8"><br></span><span class="s9">доцент кафедры, </span><span class="s8"><br></span><span class="s9">к. м. н. Федоровская </span><span class="s8"><br></span><span class="s9">Надежда Станиславовна</span><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s4"><br></span><span class="s4"><br></span></p></div></div></div></div><style type="text/css">
.s10.s10.s10 {margin-top:3px; margin-left:7px; margin-bottom:3px; margin-right:7px;}
